# Sentry — agent reference

Full skill: **`sentry`** (`.agent/skills/sentry/SKILL.md`). Claude Code / OpenCode: invoke that skill before Sentry work.

## Defaults

|        |                                      |
| ------ | ------------------------------------ |
| Org    | `kame-tech`                          |
| Region | `https://us.sentry.io`               |
| Web    | `kame-space-web` → `VITE_SENTRY_DSN` |
| Edge   | `kame-space-edge` → `SENTRY_DSN`     |

Sentry = faults. PostHog = outcomes. Never reuse DSNs across projects.

## MCP

- **OpenCode:** `opencode.json` `mcp.sentry` → `opencode mcp auth sentry`
- **Cursor:** Sentry plugin MCP (OAuth when prompted)
- **Claude Code:** user-scope HTTP MCP to `https://mcp.sentry.dev/mcp/kame-tech`

Do not put Sentry in project `.mcp.json` (OAuth HTTP; stdio-only there).

## Privacy

No email/PII in Sentry. Scrub via `telemetry/scrub.ts` + `_shared/telemetryScrub.ts` (keep in sync). Plan: `docs/workflow/done/observability-sentry-posthog-split/`.
